ip virtual-server FWS_Inbound-Web-DNAT interface ethernet1/1 original-ip 203.0.113.10 map-to 10.20.0.10 map-type port protocol tcp original-port 443 mapped-port 8443
ip virtual-server FWS_Mail-Static interface ethernet1/1 original-ip 203.0.113.25 map-to 10.20.0.25 map-type any nat-1-1-map
policy insert 1
 deactivate
 description "FWShift No-NAT-Partner"
