# Put the interfaces in their zones (this changes traffic at once):
#   zone FWS_trust / interface ethernet1/2
#   zone FWS_untrust / interface ethernet1/1
#   zone FWS_dmz / interface ethernet1/3
#   zone FWS_ot / interface ethernet1/4
